# "Dies" means put into a graveyard from the battlefield (CR 700.4). Bot2's Swords to Plowshares exiles the Traveler, so the
# trigger never happens: Bot1 has no Spirit, the Traveler is in exile, and Bot1 gains 1 life (21) from Swords (its
# controller gains life equal to its power), proving the removal did resolve.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Doomed Traveler
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Doomed Traveler.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Doomed Traveler)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 21
Exile = Doomed Traveler
Bot1.Graveyard =
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains
Stack.Count = 0
